{"type":"message","id":"6566b649","parentId":"bb8d3a78","timestamp":"2026-05-18T15:50:02.719Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the last entry is at `2026-05-18T15:49:13.233+00:00` (which is 15:49 UTC, matching the current time). The user wants to clear entries before 23:40, but it's currently only 15:49. So actually all entries would be before 23:40.\n\nMaybe the user meant a different timezone? Or maybe they meant clear entries from 00:00 to 23:40 (i.e., keep nothing since everything is before 23:40)? \n\nWait, I think I misunderstood. Current time is 15:49. The user wants to clear content before 23:40 - but that means they want to keep entries from 23:40 onwards. Since we're at 15:49 and 23:40 hasn't happened yet, that means they want to clear EVERYTHING (all entries are before 23:40).\n\nOr maybe the user is in a different timezone (Asia/Shanghai is UTC+8). If they're in China, their local time would be 23:49, and they want to clear entries before 23:40... Actually wait, let me recalculate: 15:49 UTC = 23:49 Shanghai time (UTC+8). So the current Shanghai time is 23:49, which is AFTER 23:40.\n\nHmm, this is getting confusing. Let me just check if there's anything after 23:40 in the log.\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n当前时间是 `15:49 UTC`，也就是 `23:49` 北京时间。日志里最晚的条目是 `15:49`，全部都在 23:40 之前。\n\n你是想**只保留 23:40 之后的内容**吗？但现在还没到 23:40，所以这个操作意味着**清空整个日志**——正确吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":5990,"output":378,"cacheRead":15312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21680,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779119382418,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a241477a-96c1-4fe2-933e-551331b201f1"}}
