y=allowlist` 就不会再出现。\n\n如果还出现，我来看看 `groupAllowFrom` 具体怎么配。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":99,"output":468,"cacheRead":30272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30839,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779120326787,"responseId":"chatcmpl-6fd95f54-e21f-43ac-aedb-e6f18aa090ab"}}
