{"type":"message","id":"d6fe8ffe","parentId":"0a2ebc40","timestamp":"2026-05-19T03:31:44.303Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to check which Feishu permissions are needed for writing to cloud documents (wiki/docs). Let me think about this.\n\nFrom what I know about Feishu's permission system:\n- `wiki:wiki` - seems generic, probably not a real permission\n- `wiki:node:update` - updating wiki nodes - needed for writing\n- `wiki:space:write_only` - doesn't sound right, \"write_only\" isn't a standard Feishu scope\n- `wiki:space:read` - reading wiki spaces\n- `wiki:space:retrieve` - retrieving wiki spaces\n- `wiki:node:retrieve` - retrieving wiki nodes\n\n\n- For document write operations, I need `docx:document:write` as the primary permission, and `docx:document:read` for reading. For wiki functionality, the correct scopes are `wiki:space:read` for viewing spaces, `wiki:node:read` for retrieving nodes, and `wiki:node:write` for updating them, along with `wiki:space:write` for managing spaces themselves.\n- Looking at what the user provided, `wiki:space:write_only` isn't a valid Feishu OAuth scope, and `wiki:wiki` appears to be malformed as well. I should recommend sticking with the standard write permissions like `wiki:node:write` and `wiki:space:write` instead.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n不完全对。`wiki:` 开头的权限看起来不太对，飞书开放平台的标准 scope 不是这样命名的。\n\n写入云文档（文档/知识库）通常需要这些：\n\n**文档 (Docx) 写权限：**\n- `docx:document:write` — 写入文档\n- `docx:document:read` — 读取文档（写入前可能需要）\n\n**知识库 (Wiki) 写权限：**\n- `wiki:space:write` — 操作知识库空间\n- `wiki:node:write` — 创建/编辑知识库节点\n\n你列的几个问题：\n- `wiki:wiki` — 不是标准 scope\n- `wiki:space:write_only` — 没有这个，正确的应该是 `wiki:space:write`\n- `wiki:node:retrieve` — 应该是 `wiki:node:read` 或 `wiki:node:write`\n\n建议用飞书开放平台的能力中心里的「云文档」权限来配置，系统会自动给出正确的 scope 列表。需要我帮你查一下具体要申请哪些吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":29585,"output":514,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30211,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779161475210,"responseId":"chatcmpl-8b6ec5ea-1505-422b-bb0d-37078b524ac0"}}
{"type":"message","id":"04cb11bf","parentId":"41132fc7","timestamp":"2026-05-19T03:31:44.415Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6f89d9b00cbcc2eb143e8c16333]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 如果让你拥有飞书云文档写入权限，需要开通哪些权限，下面这些对么：\nwiki:wiki\nwiki:node:update\nwiki:space:write_only\nwiki:node:retrieve\nwiki:space:read\nwiki:space:retrieve"}],"timestamp":1779161475105}}
{"type":"message","id":"4d1bf994","parentId":"04cb11bf","timestamp":"2026-05-19T03:31:44.415Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to check which Feishu permissions are needed for writing to cloud documents (wiki/docs). Let me think about this.\n\nFrom what I know about Feishu's permission system:\n- `wiki:wiki` - seems generic, probably not a real permission\n- `wiki:node:update` - updating wiki nodes - needed for writing\n- `wiki:space:write_only` - doesn't sound right, \"write_only\" isn't a standard Feishu scope\n- `wiki:space:read` - reading wiki spaces\n- `wiki:space:retrieve` - retrieving wiki spaces\n- `wiki:node:retrieve` - retrieving wiki nodes\n\n\n- For document write operations, I need `docx:document:write` as the primary permission, and `docx:document:read` for reading. For wiki functionality, the correct scopes are `wiki:space:read` for viewing spaces, `wiki:node:read` for retrieving nodes, and `wiki:node:write` for updating them, along with `wiki:space:write` for managing spaces themselves.\n- Looking at what the user provided, `wiki:space:write_only` isn't a valid Feishu OAuth scope, and `wiki:wiki` appears to be malformed as well. I should recommend sticking with the standard write permissions like `wiki:node:write` and `wiki:space:write` instead.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n不完全对。`wiki:` 开头的权限看起来不太对，飞书开放平台的标准 scope 不是这样命名的。\n\n写入云文档（文档/知识库）通常需要这些：\n\n**文档 (Docx) 写权限：**\n- `docx:document:write` — 写入文档\n- `docx:document:read` — 读取文档（写入前可能需要）\n\n**知识库 (Wiki) 写权限：**\n- `wiki:space:write` — 操作知识库空间\n- `wiki:node:write` — 创建/编辑知识库节点\n\n你列的几个问题：\n- `wiki:wiki` — 不是标准 scope\n- `wiki:space:write_only` — 没有这个，正确的应该是 `wiki:space:write`\n- `wiki:node:retrieve` — 应该是 `wiki:node:read` 或 `wiki:node:write`\n\n建议用飞书开放平台的能力中心里的「云文档」权限来配置，系统会自动给出正确的 scope 列表。需要我帮你查一下具体要申请哪些吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"