{"type":"message","id":"631a5bd4","parentId":"1069b989","timestamp":"2026-05-19T03:42:56.592Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying that `drive:permission` doesn't exist as a scope, and is suggesting `docs:permission.member`. Let me think about this - Feishu scope naming conventions.\n\nActually, looking at Feishu's official scopes, the permission-related scopes are typically:\n- `docs:permission` - for managing document permissions\n- `drive:drive` - for cloud drive access\n\nThe user might be right that the exact scope name I gave was wrong. Feishu scopes typically follow patterns like `scope:resource:action` or similar.\n\nLet me think about what the correct scopes would be for:\n1. Document read/write - `docx:document` \n\n\n2. Permission management - possibly `docs:permission` or `drive:permission`\n3. Wiki - `wiki:wiki`\n\nThe user is pointing out that `docs:permission.member` is the right scope for managing collaborators on documents, so I should acknowledge this correction and provide the accurate Feishu scope names going forward.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n你说得对，我之前写的 `drive:permission` 不是标准 scope。\n\n正确应该是：\n\n```\ndocs:permission.member    # 查看、新增、更新、删除云文档协作者\n```\n\n飞书的权限 scope 命名规则通常是 `资源:动作`，完整列表大概是：\n\n| 功能 | 正确的 Scope |\n|------|------------|\n| 读写云文档 | `docx:document` |\n| 管理协作者 | `docs:permission.member` |\n| 云盘访问 | `drive:drive` |\n| 知识库读写 | `wiki:wiki` |\n\n感谢纠正，我去确认一下之前给的列表里还有没有其他不准确的 scope。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":33028,"output":336,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33476,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779162157084,"responseId":"chatcmpl-c8902ef5-3c24-4e88-a592-ee9191242440"}}
