{"type":"message","id":"a08ec31d","parentId":"cdcedf71","timestamp":"2026-05-19T03:44:18.278Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if `drive:drive` permission is too broad (权限过大). This is a valid concern - `drive:drive` gives access to the entire cloud drive. A more specific scope would be better for the use case.\n\nFor just docx/wiki operations, the more specific scopes would be:\n- `docx:document` - for document operations\n- `wiki:wiki` - for wiki operations\n\nThe `drive:drive` scope is a general \"云盘\" access scope that's broader than what's needed for just document writing. For the specific needs (write to docx, manage permissions), we might not need the full drive scope at all.\n\n\nI should provide a more precise breakdown of which specific permissions are actually required for the documented functionality, rather than suggesting the overly broad `drive:drive` scope.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n确实，`drive:drive` 是云盘整体访问权限，范围太大。\n\n更精准的拆分：\n\n| 权限 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| `docx:document` | 云文档读写（核心，不需要 drive:drive） |\n| `docx:document:readonly` | 读取文档内容 |\n| `wiki:wiki` | 知识库读写 |\n| `docs:permission.member` | 管理文档协作者 |\n\n实际上 `docx:document` 已经包含了文档的读写能力，**不一定需要 `drive:drive`**。只有当你需要枚举/浏览整个云盘文件时才需要它。\n\n精简到刚好够用：\n\n```\ndocx:document\ndocx:document:readonly\nwiki:wiki\ndocs:permission.member\n```\n\n这样权限最小化，只做文档写入和权限管理。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":33229,"output":341,"cacheRead":208,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33778,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779162241734,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d8971276-00de-48db-a0c0-520a92a59627"}}
{"type":"message","id":"adc3e3cd","parentId":"a08ec31d","timestamp":"2026-05-19T03:46:44.179Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6f899f592c98c24434c84d6b1e2\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-19 03:46 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6f899f592c98c24434c84d6b1e2]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: wiki:wiki 这个是否安全"}],"timestamp":1779162404068}}
{"type":"message","id":"17075477","parentId":"adc3e3cd","timestamp":"2026-05-19T03:47:35.434Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boss is asking whether `wiki:wiki` permission is safe/security. This is asking about the scope of this permission and whether granting it could be risky.\n\n`wiki:wiki` is a broad scope for Feishu's knowledge base API. Let me think about what it actually grants access to:\n\n- Reading wiki spaces and nodes\n- Creating/deleting wiki nodes\n- Moving wiki nodes\n- Accessing the structure of knowledge bases\n\nIt's a fairly broad permission that could allow a bot to:\n1. Read all knowledge base content\n2. Create/modify/delete wiki nodes\n3. Restructure the entire knowledge base\n\nSo yes, `wiki:wiki` is actually quite broad and potentially risky. \n\nSince we're specifically creating nodes rather than deleting or modifying existing ones, I could suggest more granular permissions like `wiki:node:create` if the platform supports them. That said, Feishu's scope system can be fairly coarse, so `wiki:wiki` might be the only option available depending on what they expose.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n`wiki:wiki` 权限范围确实不小，允许：\n\n- 读取所有知识库内容\n- 创建/编辑/删除知识库节点\n- 修改知识库结构\n\n如果只是**新增内容**，这个权限有点过剩。但飞书知识库 API 没有更细粒度的 scope（没有 `wiki:node:create` 这种），所以通常只能用这个。\n\n**降低风险的方式：**\n- 知识库本身可以设置「仅对特定人员可见」\n- OpenClaw 作为 bot 账号只加到需要它操作的特定空间，不用它访问整个组织的知识库\n\n如果你们知识库有多个 space，可以让 OpenClaw 只加入需要它写入的那个 space，权限边界就隔离了。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":33559,"output":352,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34023,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779162404180,"responseId":"chatcmpl-dfd86f54-1232-43a5-9802-a6e1659cd4db"}}
{"type":"message","id":"72d19984","parentId":"a08ec31d","timestamp":"2026-05-19T03:47:35.689Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[message_id: om_x100b6f899f592c98c24434c84d6b1e2]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: wiki:wiki 这个是否安全"}],"timestamp":1779162404068}}
{"type":"message","id":"574d11cd","parentId":"72d19984","timestamp":"2026-05-19T03:47:35.689Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boss is asking whether `wiki:wiki` permission is safe/security. This is asking about the scope of this permission and whether granting it could be risky.\n\n`wiki:wiki` is a broad scope for Feishu's knowledge base API. Let me think about what it actually grants access to:\n\n- Reading wiki spaces and nodes\n- Creating/deleting wiki nodes\n- Moving wiki nodes\n- Accessing the structure of knowledge bases\n\nIt's a fairly broad permission that could allow a bot to:\n1. Read all knowledge base content\n2. Create/modify/delete wiki nodes\n3. Restructure the entire knowledge base\n\nSo yes, `wiki:wiki` is actually quite broad and potentially risky. \n\nSince we're specifically creating nodes rather than deleting or modifying existing ones, I could suggest more granular permissions like `wiki:node:create` if the platform supports them. That said, Feishu's scope system can be fairly coarse, so `wiki:wiki` might be the only option available depending on what they expose.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n`wiki:wiki` 权限范围确实不小，允许：\n\n- 读取所有知识库内容\n- 创建/编辑/删除知识库节点\n- 修改知识库结构\n\n如果只是**新增内容**，这个权限有点过剩。但飞书知识库 API 没有更细粒度的 scope（没有 `wiki:node:create` 这种），所以通常只能用这个。\n\n**降低风险的方式：**\n- 知识库本身可以设置「仅对特定人员可见」\n- OpenClaw 作为 bot 账号只加到需要它操作的特定空间，不用它访问整个组织的知识库\n\n如果你们知识库有多个 space，可以让 OpenClaw 只加入需要它写入的那个 space，权限边界就隔离了。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":33559,"output":352,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34023,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779162404180,"responseId":"chatcmpl-dfd86f54-1232-43a5-9802-a6e1659cd4db"}}
